{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 35, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. As soon as I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant energy of the country. From the bustling streets of Tokyo to the serene gardens of Kyoto, Japan has a unique ability to balance modernity and tradition.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The sights and smells of the market were overwhelming, but the fresh sushi I sampled was well worth it. I also had the opportunity to visit the historic city of Kyoto, where I strolled through the beautiful Arashiyama Bamboo Grove and marveled at the stunning Kinkaku-ji Temple.\n\nJapanese culture is deeply rooted in respect and tradition, and this was evident in every aspect of my trip. From the polite service at restaurants to the intricate designs of the temples and gardens, Japan is a country that values beauty and simplicity.\n\nAs I traveled through Japan, I was struck by the contrasts between old and new. Ancient temples stood alongside neon-lit skyscrapers, and traditional tea houses were nestled in the midst of bustling cities. It was a fascinating and enriching experience that left me with a deep appreciation for this complex and captivating country. I'm already planning my next trip back to Japan, eager to explore more of its hidden gems and experience the unique culture that makes it so special.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.47522157430648804}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.0041772969998419285}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20426733791828156}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5806462168693542}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.000351009744